{"id":"ee571dca34fde189","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-arith-random.md","title":"算术随机性","display":"df-arith-random — 算术随机性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-arith-random","aliases":["43-df-arith-random"],"display":"df-arith-random — 算术随机性","depends_on":["[[43-df-nrandom]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§9.7 Definition 9.7.1(iv)，印刷189，PDF209","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-arith-random"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-arith-random</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-arith-random — 算术随机性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"86bdc33f83ee57a9\" href=\"?note=86bdc33f83ee57a9\" title=\"43-df-nrandom\">43-df-nrandom</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§9.7 Definition 9.7.1(iv)，印刷189，PDF209"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Random}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Random}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"86bdc33f83ee57a9\" href=\"?note=86bdc33f83ee57a9\" title=\"43-df-nrandom\">43-df-nrandom</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithRandom}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词，以下Assertion给出其定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithRandom}(X)\\iff\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\mathrm{Random}_n(X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ArithRandom}(X)\\iff\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\mathrm{Random}_n(X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是一族有限阶条件的合取；不等同于相对于0^(ω)的ML随机性。</p>\n<p>来源：§9.7 Definition 9.7.1(iv)，印刷189，PDF209。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-nrandom","status":"resolved","id":"86bdc33f83ee57a9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-nrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-nrandom","status":"resolved","id":"86bdc33f83ee57a9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\mathrm{Random}_n$ 见 [[43-df-nrandom]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Random}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArithRandom}","display":false},{"tex":"2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArithRandom}(X)\\iff\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\;\\mathrm{Random}_n(X).","display":true}],"bytes":1007,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-161","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-arith-random]] — 算术随机性"},{"id":"574b0b43d52660b1","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；各定义见 [[43-df-arith-random]]、[[43-df-nrandom]]、[[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-jump]]。"},{"id":"f25448b015526e19","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mu$ 采用 [[43-df-cylinder]] 的Cantor空间公平硬币Borel概率测度；$\\mathrm{ArithRandom}$ 见 [[43-df-arith-random]]。"}],"outgoing":["86bdc33f83ee57a9"]}